WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.890
The p H scale runs from zero to fourteen.

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:06.700
Seven is neutral, like pure water.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:11.240
Below seven is acidic: lemon juice is about two.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:15.270
Above seven is alkaline: soap is about ten.

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:17.850
Mix an acid and an alkali, and they neutralise:

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:20.200
salt and water.

